          "inlines": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Three water hoses are used to fill a large swimming pool.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The first hose alone would take 200 hours.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The second hose takes 120 hours and the third hose 50 hours.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "How long would it take to fill the pool?",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "30 hours",
      "worked": "The combined rate is the sum of the three hose rates.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Combined rate}&=\\frac{1\\text{ pool}}{200\\text{ hours}}+\\frac{1\\text{ pool}}{120\\text{ hours}}+\\frac{1\\text{ pool}}{50\\text{ hours}}\\\\\\text{Combined rate}&=\\frac{3+5+12\\text{ pools}}{600\\text{ hours}}\\\\\\text{Combined rate}&=\\frac{20\\text{ pools}}{600\\text{ hours}}\\\\\\text{Combined rate}&=\\frac{1\\text{ pool}}{30\\text{ hours}}\\end{align*}$$\nThe pool will take **30 hours** to fill.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 42
  },
